}

.fc-dm-app-header,
.fc-dm-mission-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--fc-dm-line);
  padding-bottom: 0.65rem;
}

.fc-dm-app-header > div,
.fc-dm-mission-header > div {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-width: 0;
}

.fc-dm-app-header span,
.fc-dm-mission-header span,
.fc-dm-form-grid label > span,
.fc-dm-stat span,
.fc-dm-objective-card > span {
  color: var(--fc-dm-muted);
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.13em;
}

.fc-dm-app-header strong {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.fc-dm-app-header small {
  color: var(--fc-dm-muted);
  font-size: 0.64rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.fc-dm-mission-header h2 {
  margin: 0.15rem 0 0;
  color: var(--fc-dm-cyan);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.fc-dm-mission-header > strong {
  color: var(--fc-dm-cyan);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-align: right;
}

.fc-dm-objective,
.fc-dm-objective-card,
.fc-dm-result-reason,
.fc-dm-empty,
.fc-dm-error {
  border: 1px solid var(--fc-dm-line);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--fc-dm-cyan);
  padding: 0.75rem;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
}

.fc-dm-empty {
  margin: auto 0;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--fc-dm-muted);
}

.fc-dm-error {
  border-left-color: #d56a68;
  color: #f2b3b0;
}

.fc-dm-result-reason {
  border-left-color: #d8c56b;
}

.fc-dm-round-strip,
.fc-dm-zone-banner,
.fc-dm-control-banner {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  min-height: 2.3rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--fc-dm-line);
  padding: 0.45rem 0.65rem;
  background: rgba(36, 100, 103, 0.14);
}

.fc-dm-zone-banner,
.fc-dm-control-banner {
  justify-content: center;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.fc-dm-stat-grid,
.fc-dm-zone-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 0.55rem;
}

.fc-dm-stat,
.fc-dm-zone-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.25rem;
  min-width: 0;
  border: 1px solid var(--fc-dm-line);
  padding: 0.65rem;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.19);
}

.fc-dm-stat strong {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
}

.fc-dm-stat.allied strong,
.fc-dm-zone-card[data-controller="friendly"] > span {
  color: #78dfce;
}

.fc-dm-stat.hostile strong,
.fc-dm-zone-card[data-controller="hostile"] > span {
  color: #ef8c83;
}

.fc-dm-zone-card[data-controller="contested"] > span {
  color: #e0ce7a;
}

.fc-dm-zone-card button {
  margin-top: 0.4rem;
}

.fc-dm-objective-card strong {
  color: var(--fc-dm-cyan);
  font-size: 1rem;
}

.fc-dm-objective-card small {
  color: var(--fc-dm-muted);
}

.fc-dm-setup-form,
.fc-dm-mission-panel {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.75rem;
}

.fc-dm-form-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 0.65rem;
}

.fc-dm-form-grid label {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.3rem;
  min-width: 0;
}

.fc-dm-form-grid label.wide {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
}

.fc-dm-form-grid label[hidden] {
  display: none;
}

.fc-dm-form-grid input,
.fc-dm-form-grid textarea,
.fc-dm-form-grid select {
  width: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  border: 1px solid var(--fc-dm-line);
  border-radius: 0;
  background: #0a1719;
  color: var(--fc-text, #d8f7f3);
}

.fc-dm-form-grid select[multiple] {
  min-height: 7rem;
}

.fc-dm-rules {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.8rem 1.1rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--fc-dm-line);
  padding: 0.65rem;
}

.fc-dm-rules legend {
  color: var(--fc-dm-muted);
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
}

.fc-dm-command-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}

.fc-dm-command-row button,
.fc-dm-zone-card button {
  min-height: 2.15rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--fc-dm-line);
  border-radius: 0;
  padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
  background: rgba(28, 85, 88, 0.35);
  color: var(--fc-text, #d8f7f3);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.fc-dm-command-row button:hover:not(:disabled),
.fc-dm-zone-card button:hover:not(:disabled) {
  border-color: var(--fc-dm-cyan);
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(91, 224, 217, 0.25);
}

.fc-dm-command-row button.primary {
  border-color: var(--fc-dm-cyan);
  color: var(--fc-dm-cyan);
}

.fc-dm-command-row button.danger {
  border-color: rgba(213, 106, 104, 0.6);
  color: #ef9d96;
}

.fc-dm-command-row button:disabled,
.fc-dm-zone-card button:disabled {
  opacity: 0.4;
  cursor: default;
}

.fc-dm-validation {
  min-height: 1.1rem;
  color: #ef9d96;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
}

@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .fc-dm-form-grid,
  .fc-dm-stat-grid,
  .fc-dm-zone-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .fc-dm-form-grid label.wide {
    grid-column: auto;
  }
}

# Frame Conn DM UI

`styles/ui_dm/` owns the separate **GM-facing Frame Conn // Mission application**.

The DM application is not a tab or mode inside the player cockpit. It consumes registered DM feature APIs and Foundry integration APIs through runtime composition.

## Current SITREP surface

Phase 6 provides:

- SITREP type/configuration authoring;
- Scene Region and Combatant selection;
- active objective/status/round presentation;
- scenario-specific battlefield state;
- Control scores and zone control;
- Recon scan controls with GM-only true-zone knowledge;
- Escort and Extraction objective controls;
- pause/resume/end and GM-declared results.

